    <!-- Error Messages. These reach the user through a Toast when an
         operation fails. None of them interpolate an exception message:
         release builds are minified, so `e.message` there reads as an
         R8-obfuscated class name. The detail belongs in the adjacent
         Log.e(TAG, "…", e) call, which carries the throwable. -->
